{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "总编室挡酒的职责  (Whose Duty Is Blocking Drinks?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Mentioning Chun Yuqiao's hospital stay sets Xingzi off: she blames Kaiwen for failing to block the drinks that sent Yuqiao to the emergency room, sparking an uproarious argument just before Xingtian's chairwoman walks in. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大现在病成什么样了，那还不是拜你所赐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "昨晚你把他拦住不让他喝酒，你能怎么样啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你是第一天来总编室吗？你是刚来的实习生吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他是淳于乔，他做的决定谁能拦得住？你去拦一个试试！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我去拦，我当然拦得住他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你知不知道你在总编室里的职责之一就是替老大挡酒？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你说我在总编室的职责是挡酒？你觉得我是为了挡酒进来的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那不然你觉得你是什么职责啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你动手归动手，千万别打我的头！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你是不是以为我不敢教训你？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我告诉你，我的头真的不能打，我每天早上做发型都要弄四十分钟！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长好！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大现在病成什么样了，那还不是拜你所赐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look how sick our boss is right now — is that not thanks to you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "昨晚你把他拦住不让他喝酒，你能怎么样啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you really not have held him back from drinking last night?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你是第一天来总编室吗？你是刚来的实习生吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is today your very first day in the chief editor's office? Are you a brand-new intern?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他是淳于乔，他做的决定谁能拦得住？你去拦一个试试！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is Chun Yuqiao — once he decides something, who can stop him? Try stopping him yourself!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我去拦，我当然拦得住他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I had been there, of course I would have stopped him!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你知不知道你在总编室里的职责之一就是替老大挡酒？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you not know one of your duties in the chief editor's office is blocking drinks for our boss?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你说我在总编室的职责是挡酒？你觉得我是为了挡酒进来的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My duty here is blocking drinks? Do you think I joined this office just to block toasts?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那不然你觉得你是什么职责啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what duty do you think you are here for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你动手归动手，千万别打我的头！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Argue all you want, just do not swat my head!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你是不是以为我不敢教训你？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you think I would hesitate to set you straight?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我告诉你，我的头真的不能打，我每天早上做发型都要弄四十分钟！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am telling you, hands off my hair — I spend forty minutes styling it every single morning!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Chairwoman!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大现在病成什么样了，那还不是拜你所赐！",
      "gap": 0.5
